  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Head_items\" title=\"Category:Head items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Head.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Big_Top\">The Big Top</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #DDAAFF solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#DDA0DD;--bg-color-1-dark:#773777;--bg-color-2:#EEDDFF;--bg-color-2-dark:#3A2F45;--header-color:#DDA0DD;--header-color-dark:#773777;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\">4\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:The_Big_Top_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/The_Big_Top_shown.jpg/420px-The_Big_Top_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/The_Big_Top_shown.jpg/630px-The_Big_Top_shown.jpg 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/The_Big_Top_shown.jpg/840px-The_Big_Top_shown.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Clothing / Helm\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Head\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>, <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">Exclusive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">140\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a>:</b> <b>Leather</b> armor is made of the hide of animals. It provides decent protection without excessively restricting the user's movements.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF; width: 150px;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; width: 450px;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0001610000</span>1,610<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Under_the_Big_Top\" title=\"Under the Big Top\">Under the Big Top</a></b>, end chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Otto%27s_Resistible_Dance\" title=\"Otto&#39;s Resistible Dance\">Otto's Resistible Dance</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Otto%27s_Resistible_Dance\" title=\"Otto&#39;s Resistible Dance\">Otto's Resistible Dance</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 3<br /><b>Charges: </b>1 (1/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 1 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:1)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Use_Magic_Device\" title=\"Use Magic Device\">Use Magic Device +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Use_Magic_Device\" title=\"Use Magic Device\">Use Magic Device +1</a>:</b> Passive: +1 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Use_Magic_Device\" title=\"Use Magic Device\">Use Magic Device</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Perform\" title=\"Perform\">Perform +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Perform\" title=\"Perform\">Perform +6</a>:</b> Passive: +6 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Perform\" title=\"Perform\">Perform</a> skill.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:The_Big_Top.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/The_Big_Top.png/420px-The_Big_Top.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"480\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/The_Big_Top.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Big_Top\" title=\"Item:Epic Big Top\">Epic Big Top</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This is the strange, formal hat that <a href=\"/page/Malicia\" title=\"Malicia\">Malicia</a> was wearing when she was defeated. Placing it atop one's head confers a greater understanding of all things magical.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>Item was revamped on update 39. Earlier copies of the item have only the <a href=\"/page/Otto%27s_Resistible_Dance\" title=\"Otto&#39;s Resistible Dance\">Otto's Resistible Dance</a> and a <a href=\"/page/Use_Magic_Device\" title=\"Use Magic Device\">Enhanced Use Magic Device +1</a> <small>(which had the significance of being <a href=\"/page/Stack\" title=\"Stack\">stackable</a> due to being an <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> compared to the <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">competence bonus</a> it is now)</small>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816171509\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.133 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3301/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22033/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5637/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n117.63%  137.696     40 Template:IO\n100.00%  117.062      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  117.062      1 -total\n 96.63%  113.113      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 41.09%   48.106      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 39.46%   46.194      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 